---
# Example playbook. Copy to site.yml (outside this repo, or alongside your
# own inventory) and adjust the role path if you vendor this role elsewhere.
#
# Safety: this play reconfigures the network Ansible is connected through.
# Run with `--check --diff` first, and roll out with `--limit` / a `serial:
# 1` strategy on a cluster you care about. If a candidate configuration does
# not come up cleanly or severs connectivity, the host autonomously reverts
# to the previous working configuration after 30 seconds.

- name: Configure Proxmox VE base network stack
  hosts: proxmox
  become: true
  serial: 1
  roles:
    - role: ansible-role-proxmox-networking
